Note: 
conn.log:  Big Picture (top IPs, ports, conn_state).
sip.log:   kyunki ye doosra sabse bada hai, to kaun sa IP aur kya maanga.
http.log, ssl.log: kaun asli request bhej raha hai.
dns.log, snmp.log, ntp*.log, ldap_search.log, kerberos.log: kaun se service-probes aaye.
tunnel.log, weird.log, analyzer.log: ajeeb cheezein.

================================================================================ File -Analysis
- 
  conn_state : how connection was closed

       Value	                         Matlab                                      	Honeypot me kya
       S0                      	SYN gaya, koi jawab nahi	Scan,                     jawab nahi mila
       REJ	                    SYN ke jawab me RST aaya	                          Port band tha, scan
       SF                      	Normal connection,                                  theek se khatam	Asli baatcheet hui
       RSTO / RSTR	            Connection RST se toda gaya                        	Aksar scan ya attack





